    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f ADD OUR NEW GAMES TO WISHLIST \u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\udd25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/\u0433\u0435\u0442\u0442\u0438\u043d\u0433 \u0438 \u0444\u0435\u043c\u0431\u043e\u0439?t=1755250150\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/3bed5e422eca106ba41132fd1611f27d.avif?t=1755250150\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious monsters crawl from the dungeons and plague the lands of Lynderia. Shana, the High Priestess of the goddess Tona, decides to start her own crusade and search for the very core of the problem - and deal with it. A girl named Maya comes to her side. They descend into the ruins of an abandoned Temple, where they cross paths not only with hideous creatures but also with an enigmatic stranger, Victoria.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It soon becomes clear that she is also fighting monsters, so the three women join forces.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/3bed5e422eca106ba41132fd1611f27d.avif?t=1755250150\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/b10c8ab499d3ff45fd7a6be81ca1d633.poster.webp?t=1755250150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/b10c8ab499d3ff45fd7a6be81ca1d633.webp?t=1755250150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/296e6208fce99cf80ce8fd0387ad8dd5.avif?t=1755250150\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike auto battler with three difficulty levels, suited both for those who love hardcore modes and those who look for a pleasant evening.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture every dungeon level, crush all bosses, and unfold the truth about Lynderia\u2019s history. Maybe there is some force behind the monster invasion\u2026 or some person.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/3bed5e422eca106ba41132fd1611f27d.avif?t=1755250150\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/960904f634a162cc50e448d0ca133c94.poster.webp?t=1755250150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/960904f634a162cc50e448d0ca133c94.webp?t=1755250150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/296e6208fce99cf80ce8fd0387ad8dd5.avif?t=1755250150\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge victorious from a battle with a boss\u2026 and don\u2019t let them escape so easily \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 steaming-hot sex scenes with dungeon bosses. Show who\u2019s the real number one here!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/3bed5e422eca106ba41132fd1611f27d.avif?t=1755250150\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/e037307666fa1abc01a7e49a06cc2730.poster.webp?t=1755250150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/e037307666fa1abc01a7e49a06cc2730.webp?t=1755250150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757060/extras/296e6208fce99cf80ce8fd0387ad8dd5.avif?t=1755250150\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels, for those who like it smooth or rough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose your fighting companions, changing your battle style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 monster types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ tasty &quot;win&quot; sex animations with 100+ variations as a prize for defeating the dungeon bosses!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10+ hours of hot addictive gameplay!</p></li></ul>",
